# Text files are kept with Unix line ends on every system, so a file
# never changes only because of where it was edited.
* text=auto eol=lf

# HoloML test pages are read byte for byte (their error positions are checked).
*.holoml -text
# The example sites (showroom, Blockworld, and later ones) are
# byte-for-byte copies of HoloML's (checked by hash in
# packages/holoml/src/copy.test.ts), so no line-ending conversion for
# anything under the HoloML fixtures.
tests/fixtures/holoml/** -text
